      "evidence": "native.rs:78-82,86-136 vs baseline finalize_documents; lib.rs:56-58,118-120,139-152 vs baseline",
      "independent_probe": "Nonempty seed policies retain NATIVE001 before invalid source key/default; empty policies then invalid source key retain DTO002; invalid annotation authority remains POL005 before /2 defaults rejection"
